Package: xplyr
Type: Package
Title: See What Changes in Data Pipelines
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Joshua", "Kunst", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "jbkunst@gmail.com")
Description: A small experimental companion for 'dplyr' pipelines. It adds
    lightweight console feedback about notable consequences of data
    transformations, with an initial pedagogical focus on filter() and mutate().
